<h2>Concept Note</h2>

<div class="concept">

<p>

My artistic practice begins with careful observation of nature and the unnoticed details that surround us. I am inspired by insects, plants, leaves, seeds, and the relationships they create within ecosystems. Through painting and sculpture, I explore themes of memory, transformation, and the hidden beauty that often goes unnoticed.

Rather than documenting nature scientifically, I use observation as a way of understanding the quiet connections between humans and the natural world. My work invites viewers to slow down, look closely, and appreciate the unseen life that exists around us.

</p>

